# Google Analytics 4 Measurement ID.
# Find it in GA4 > Admin > Data streams > your web stream > "Measurement ID".
# GA only loads in production builds, so localhost stays out of your data.
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and set the real value there (gitignored),
# and ALSO add it in Netlify > Site settings > Environment variables.
NEXT_PUBLIC_GA_ID=G-XXXXXXXXXX
